資料等）を考えています。\nもしご都合が合えばよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15QcfblJ6ABjLUrKZ3ijKi-ncxD6c6GKd", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": []}, "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 2000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T13:59:00.671621+00:00"}]}}